Report drift between the workspace and manovaspace/ci/ci/versions.env, resolved dependency versions and kit exports shadowed by local code. The audit is read-only: it never edits a repository and reads the network only with 'audit deps --remote'. Exit codes: 0 no ERROR findings, 1 at least one ERROR, 2 something could not be verified.

Usage:
  orbit audit [flags]
  orbit audit [command]

Available Commands:
  deps        Report resolved dependency versions, forbidden ranges and shadowed exports
  usage       Verify kit imports against the installed package exports
  versions    Compare tool versions with manovaspace/ci/ci/versions.env

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for audit
      --json   Print the report as a JSON envelope

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit audit [command] --help" for more information about a command.
